{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evenfall is an upcoming point-and-click visual novel by Niv, with music by turingsghost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras/a97661ef07a5ed2a2aaca03c2d7302ee.avif?t=1773255985\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras_big/a97661ef07a5ed2a2aaca03c2d7302ee.webp?t=1773255985 width=1600 height=402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY SO FAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evenfall is known as the city of eternal sunset\u2014an ex-mining colony where the sun hangs motionless below the horizon. Countless robots eke out a living under its flickering streetlights. One day, all of the city's outgoing communication goes dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When intrepid technician Indigo is sent to diagnose the issue, they quickly hit it off with the locals. They've always preferred the company of machines over their fellow humans, and the cuties at the local bar are no exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with megacorporate support dwindling, Evenfall is on the brink of collapse. As Indigo digs into the city's secrets, they uncover a conspiracy that might finally spell an end to the twilit metropolis\u2014with Indigo caught in the middle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras/6ce0c27a03017e0045edd4ea09d6809a.avif?t=1773255985\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras_big/6ce0c27a03017e0045edd4ea09d6809a.webp?t=1773255985 width=1600 height=402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THERE ARE CUTE ROBOTS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt; TAZ</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run across this charming loner in a bar, be careful of his silver tongue\u2014he's just as likely to swipe your chits as he is to take you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt; EM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the last employees in Evenfall's gutted Department of Information, Em knows to keep their head down. But when the streetlights turn off, she dreams of chronicling the city's complex history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt; SHONKHOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned by his multibillionaire owner, Shonkhor is in search of a new directive to follow. But can he find someone to fill the human-shaped hole in his heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras/76722417b2bf3523089716714a37f3a8.avif?t=1773255985\" width=1600 height=992 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949990?t=1773255985","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/ca10f9dead4bcacb4f1f70e5ea54b9ec9a376f57/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773255985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/28fbba674bb1a2c9b88bfce8e7e5b02b93cf4a3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773255985","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/28fbba674bb1a2c9b88bfce8e7e5b02b93cf4a3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773255985","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4492920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evenfall is an upcoming point-and-click visual novel by Niv, with music by turingsghost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 